/* --- lv accent identity ------------------------------------------------
   Colour-only layer on top of the existing card system: a gradient spine
   across the top of the card, a faint wash behind the header, and a hover
   lift tinted with the same hue. Every card used to be an identical white
   rectangle, which made a column of them read as one grey slab.
